，以寵，久之即禍及身矣。」勃懼，亦自危，乃謝請歸相印。上許之。歲餘，丞相平卒，上復以勃為丞相。十餘月，上曰：「前日吾詔列侯就國，或未能行，丞相吾所重，其率先之。」乃免相就國。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m009-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m009-0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m009-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"人","kind":"person","person_id":"vs4_jiv_8ps","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"依本段可分辨受得官員、軍事主體或說話者記未名候選，不補姓名；獄吏教策前後同一敘事，末句安知獄吏之貴泛論未強併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m009-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m009-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"代王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m009-0071","start":71,"end":72,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m009-0085","start":85,"end":86,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m009-0094","start":94,"end":95,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"i3f_9l9_g53","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m009-0097","start":97,"end":98,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m009-0100","start":100,"end":101,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m009-0109","start":109,"end":110,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-057","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-057-zhou"}],"sources":[{"chapter_